      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以呢，我的目标目前先这样就够了。\n尽可能地参加比赛、习惯比赛──\n……我要为了未来那个时刻努力累积战绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5266d42f8eeefb22345a38ae15433cda8f6a6bfe80e1bb42540c118aa3a842a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
